WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes is an inviting idea. It is also only a duration.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
An audio product describes a routine; that does not establish its effects.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
To test an hour-for-twelve-minutes promise, define the outcomes first.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Then compare real people, suitable controls, and repeatable results.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Try free listening formats and notice what you actually enjoy.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Choose with evidence. No purchase is required to begin.
